Z||000000||Jaygee79||10-23-2001||12:29 AM||||My house is infested with ladybugs.  It started out with find 1 or 2 a night.  Tonight I've already killed at least 15 of them.  It's disgusting.  I've resorted to spraying them with Dow Scrubbing Bubbles.  Kills them fast, especially if you can get close enough so that it foams.  I think I've sprayed too much of it though because my eyes and nose are starting to feel funny.  They are driving me insane!  I'm afraid to go to bed.  I don't want them bouncing off my head all night long.||||reg||1
Z||000001||72vinman||10-23-2001||12:35 AM||||This summer has been real bad for lady bugs but it's not their fault. This summer we had an infestation of aphids. Lady bugs feed off of them so they follow them wherever they go.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jaygee79||10-23-2001||12:38 AM||||I know they don't harm anyone, but I absolutely refuse to share my house with any kind of bug-like creature.  I feel kinda bad killing them, but if I shooed them all outside I'd have the window open all night.  Our front door was literally covered with them on Saturday.||||reg||1
