Z||000029||Jefrysuko||10-24-2001||01:23 AM||||I was out in the middle of nowhere at an motorcross track this weekend doing some testing with the minibaja team this weekend and the orange ones were all over.  One guy started getting little red spots where they were bitting.  From what I understand they have had a large population the past few years and like to make homes in the unsealed cracks of your house.  You might want to check the perimeter of your house and see if there are any areas that they could get in.  I caulked around the trim of a window for my sister and solved a similar problem for her.||||reg||1
